<title>RUSSIA: Russian PPI quickens to 2.8 pct monthly in October.</title>
<headline>Russian PPI quickens to 2.8 pct monthly in October.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian monthly industrial prices rose 2.8 percent in October after 1.8 percent in September, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL PRICES  OCT 96    SEP 96   OCT 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month pct change   +2.8	 +1.8     +5.0</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change     N/A	 +31.4   +230</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
